{"ID":"20240513083308-nvdfzlg","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513083308-nvdfzlg","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513083308-nvdfzlg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513115412-k1xgkev\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513115412-k1xgkev\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:100,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513115412-k1xgkev\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:499,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:546\u0026#125;","title":"102","type":"doc","updated":"20240515123415"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513115412-k1xgkev","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 969px;","id":"20240513115412-k1xgkev","updated":"20240515123415"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 初診日期："}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"080-4 L, R"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中年，中等身材"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5/5/2008"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自覺右下腹脹痛、似欲爆開(burst)"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診：\n1、睡眠："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、胃口："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"平平"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3、大便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"每日二次"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"4、小便："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"深黃 (發炎"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→病在陽明‧無死証"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"5、口渴："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"渴欲飲熱 (飲熱"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→非炎証，蓋有炎証時必欲飲冷"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":")"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"6、手足溫度："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"手足俱溫"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"7、掌額溫度："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"掌額俱溫"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"8、問汗：\n9、體力：\n10、頭身："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡時身甚熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"11、生理期：\n12、其他："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 腸中有水聲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"舌紅苔黃乾 (陽明、但熱不寒)"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 慢性盲腸炎、腹膜炎"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針灸處方： "}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中藥處方：  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 大黃牡丹皮湯1＋薏苡附子敗醬散1  200粒膠囊 8粒/次，三餐前各一次"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. HT-45 (己椒藶黃丸) 3瓶，芒硝一罐﹕中餐後芒硝三茶匙沖服HT-45 25粒"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之前, 此病人曾以慢性盲腸炎／腹膜炎疼痛不舒不能出門逾十五年，經倪師以大黃牡丹皮湯±大柴胡湯治療而得以行動。盲腸破口後，在週圍形成一保護袋以致西醫無法以驗血得知慢性炎証。今日病人雖自述欲爆感，但因飲熱，可斷定保護袋未爆﹔祇是原來的盲腸破口未癒，保護袋脹而欲動。"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"餘見HT-45說明http://www.hantang.com/chinese/ch_cm/cm-045.htm"}]}]}]}]}